        ],
        "abstract": "In this paper, a microstrip antenna with Micro-Electro-Mechanical-System (MEMS) battery has been designed and simulated. The novel antenna with the MEMS battery has been designed and simulated using high frequency simulating software (HFSS) for GPS (1.1/1.25 GHz), Wireless (2.4/2.5 GHz), WI-FI and aeronautical internal communications (5.1 GHz and 5.2 GHz). Energy efficient MEMS power battery was designed to sit on the heart of the antenna and will operate at a centre frequency of 5150-5250 MHz, 5250-5350 MHz for Aeronautical internal communication and WI-FI 5 GHz (5180-5850 MHz) in addition to the GPS and the wireless as stated above.",
